{"reviewId": "414635657_8bV8t214h", "review": {"abstract": "所以，未来的机会更多地存在于结构变动而不是总量的变化中，这是一个投资逻辑的改变。按照我们对当前资本市场的认识，至少在可以预见的一两年内，市场对机会的认识和把握都不可能是前10年的重复，而是一个颠覆。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "也就是说，外部的周期如果没有增加，那么，我们也不会有增加的更大空间，所以经济结构转变只能是在全球总需求量里面的玩。也就是，存量经济。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "1824-1923", "createTime": 1788703977, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "414635657_8bV8t214h", "userVid": 414635657, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 414635657, "name": "大国", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-mRA3AdfMOI5PcWkDqas1a10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "事业、阅读、咖啡、茶", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "地球交书友：savoury-", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIn